{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "notify-chain-api-v1",
    "name": "NotifyChain API — Public Workflows",
    "description": "Complete Postman collection for the NotifyChain Listener HTTP API (issue #992).\n\nAll public endpoints are included and grouped by workflow. Secrets and\nper-environment values are parameterized via collection variables so a\nmaintainer can execute every request against a local instance immediately\nafter importing this file.\n\n## Quick-start\n1. Import this file into Postman (File → Import).\n2. Open \"Environments\" and set the variables listed below, or edit the\n   collection-level defaults directly.\n3. Start the listener: `cd listener && npm run dev`\n4. Run the \"Health\" request to confirm connectivity, then explore by folder.\n\n## Collection variables (override per environment)\n| Variable            | Default                | Purpose                                    |\n|---------------------|------------------------|--------------------------------------------|\n| `base_url`          | http://localhost:3000  | Listener service URL                       |\n| `api_key`           | dev-api-key-1          | X-API-Key for protected endpoints          |\n| `webhook_secret`    | change-me-in-production| HMAC-SHA256 secret for POST /api/webhooks  |\n| `webhook_key_id`    | key-1                  | Key identifier sent in X-Webhook-Key-Id    |\n| `schedule_id`       | 1                      | Notification ID used in GET/DELETE /api/schedule/:id |\n| `template_id`       | 1                      | Template ID used in template GET/PUT/DELETE |\n| `user_id`           | user-123               | User ID for preferences endpoints          |\n\n## Signature helper (Pre-request script)\nThe `POST /api/v1/webhooks` request includes a Pre-request Script that\nautomatically computes a valid HMAC-SHA256 signature using the collection\nvariables, so no manual signing is required.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url",         "value": "http://localhost:3000", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "api_key",          "value": "dev-api-key-1",        "type": "string" },
    { "key": "webhook_secret",   "value": "change-me-in-production", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "webhook_key_id",   "value": "key-1",                "type": "string" },
    { "key": "schedule_id",      "value": "1",                    "type": "string" },
    { "key": "template_id",      "value": "1",                    "type": "string" },
    { "key": "user_id",          "value": "user-123",             "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Infrastructure",
      "description": "Non-versioned infrastructure endpoints. These are not prefixed with /api/v1 and have no planned deprecation.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/health",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["health"]
            },
            "description": "Returns an aggregated health status for every service dependency:\nStellar RPC, Discord, SQLite database, and the in-memory event registry.\n\nResponds with 200 when all dependencies are healthy, or 503 when any\ncritical dependency reports an error."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK — all healthy",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"status\": \"ok\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-15T12:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"services\": {\n    \"stellarRpc\": { \"status\": \"ok\", \"latencyMs\": 42 },\n    \"discord\":    { \"status\": \"ok\", \"latencyMs\": 18 },\n    \"database\":   { \"status\": \"ok\" },\n    \"eventRegistry\": { \"status\": \"ok\", \"eventCount\": 12 }\n  }\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "503 Service Unavailable — degraded",
              "status": "Service Unavailable",
              "code": 503,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"status\": \"error\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-15T12:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"services\": {\n    \"stellarRpc\": { \"status\": \"error\", \"detail\": \"Health check timed out\" },\n    \"discord\":    { \"status\": \"ok\", \"latencyMs\": 18 },\n    \"database\":   { \"status\": \"ok\" },\n    \"eventRegistry\": { \"status\": \"ok\", \"eventCount\": 0 }\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
