    {
      "name": "Webhooks",
      "description": "Inbound signed webhook acceptance. External services post signed events here.\n\nAll requests MUST be signed with HMAC-SHA256. See the Pre-request Script on\n'Accept signed webhook' for the automatic signing logic.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Accept signed webhook",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "// Automatically compute a valid HMAC-SHA256 signature.",
                  "// Requires the CryptoJS library bundled in Postman.",
                  "const secret    = pm.collectionVariables.get('webhook_secret');",
                  "const keyId     = pm.collectionVariables.get('webhook_key_id');",
                  "const rawBody   = pm.request.body.raw;",
                  "const timestamp = Math.floor(Date.now() / 1000).toString();",
                  "",
                  "// Signing input: '<timestamp>.<raw-body>'",
                  "const signingInput = timestamp + '.' + rawBody;",
                  "const hex = CryptoJS.HmacSHA256(signingInput, secret).toString(CryptoJS.enc.Hex);",
                  "const signature = 'sha256=' + hex;",
                  "",
                  "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-Webhook-Signature',  value: signature });",
                  "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-Webhook-Key-Id',     value: keyId });",
                  "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-Webhook-Timestamp',  value: timestamp });"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 202 Accepted', () => pm.response.to.have.status(202));",
                  "pm.test('Response has verified:true', () => {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(json.verified).to.be.true;",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "X-Webhook-Signature",  "value": "{{computed_in_prerequest}}", "description": "Set automatically by Pre-request Script" },
              { "key": "X-Webhook-Key-Id",     "value": "{{webhook_key_id}}" },
              { "key": "X-Webhook-Timestamp",  "value": "{{computed_in_prerequest}}", "description": "Set automatically by Pre-request Script" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"notification\",\n  \"id\": \"evt-postman-001\",\n  \"contractAddress\": \"CEXAMPLECONTRACTADDRESSAAAAAAAAAAAA\",\n  \"eventName\": \"transfer\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"from\": \"GABC\",\n    \"to\": \"GXYZ\",\n    \"amount\": \"100\"\n  }\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/webhooks",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "webhooks"]
            },
            "description": "Submit a signed notification payload.\n\nThe Pre-request Script computes the HMAC-SHA256 signature automatically:\n  signingInput = timestamp + '.' + rawBody\n  signature    = 'sha256=' + HMAC-SHA256(signingInput, webhook_secret)\n\nThe server validates:\n1. `X-Webhook-Signature` has the `sha256=` prefix\n2. `X-Webhook-Key-Id` matches a configured secret\n3. `X-Webhook-Timestamp` is within 5 minutes\n4. The HMAC over `timestamp.rawBody` matches\n\nReturns 202 Accepted when the signature is valid."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "202 Accepted",
              "status": "Accepted",
              "code": 202,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{ \"status\": \"accepted\", \"verified\": true }"
            },
            {
              "name": "401 Unauthorized — invalid signature",
              "status": "Unauthorized",
              "code": 401,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{ \"error\": \"Invalid signature\", \"code\": \"AUTH_INVALID_SIGNATURE\" }"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Notifications — Scheduling",
      "description": "Create, inspect, and cancel scheduled notifications.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Schedule a notification",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.test('Response has id', () => {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(json.id).to.be.a('number');",
